  "items": [
    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天想和你聊聊“更改出行计划”。这件事最近对我影响挺大。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以。你现在最想解决的是什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我先做了一个计划，可实际情况和我想的不太一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "计划本来就需要调整，先看最重要的部分。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我发现自己有时候太快做选择，没有先问清楚。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这和经验有关，多做几次会更稳。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "还有沟通的问题，我怕说得太直接。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "把原因说明白，再听听对方的想法，通常会好很多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我的责任应该到哪里？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "先把自己负责的部分做好，遇到不确定的地方及时确认。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我想把这件事变成一个稳定的习惯。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那就从小一点的动作开始，不用一次做得太多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果中间又出问题呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "先解决眼前的问题，再记录原因，下次就会更快。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样做真的能看到进步吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "能。你可以每周回头看一次，会发现变化比想象中明显。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我以前总觉得一定要有最好的方法。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "其实适合现在情况的方法更重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_019.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "听起来我应该少一点着急，多一点观察。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_020.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，尤其是“更改出行计划”这种事，过程本身也很重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_021.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我今天先做一个具体的小步骤。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_022.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "很好，做完以后再决定下一步，不需要一次想完。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_023.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "谢谢，我现在思路清楚多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "file": "hsk3_sc024_line_024.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "不客气。过几天我们再看看效果。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
